{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square","id":973670,"title":"Are the NWO and the Syndicate scientists by the square?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-20T22:14:06-07:00","id":973670,"title":"Are the NWO and the Syndicate scientists by the square?","content":"Could call them scientists in technical, traditional sense?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","name":"Posthumanity","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T23:51:39-07:00","id":973695,"title":"","content":"Sure. The NWO does a lot of behavioral modification stuff, I'm sure they have their own research department to develop it. And some people think of economics as a soft science, like sociology.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1503-faradn","name":"Faradn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1503_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"792"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T01:16:06-07:00","id":973715,"title":"","content":"Some of them are. Most aren't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T03:42:42-07:00","id":973745,"title":"","content":"If by scientists you mean also social scientists then yes they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T05:02:13-07:00","id":973762,"title":"","content":"All Conventions have people who do lab/theory work, and fieldwork people. NWO has MIBs, Syndicate has enforcers, IX has cyborg killing machines, Progenitors have biomodded killing machines, VE has space Marines. They also have as I said people who don't do these things, Ivory tower, Hyper economists etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T05:03:24-07:00","id":973763,"title":"","content":"Even Iteration X and the Progenitors aren't all hard science. Many Technocrats aren't even that. You don't have to be a scientist to be part of the Technocracy. Science is a tool and a Trojan Horse for the Technocracy's ideology.<br /> <br /> Though I kind of want to draw a carnival ride with a &quot;You must be this sciencey to enter&quot; bar.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T05:41:41-07:00","id":973775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=973762#post973762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All Conventions have people who do lab/theory work, and fieldwork people. NWO has MIBs, Syndicate has enforcers, IX has cyborg killing machines, Progenitors have biomodded killing machines, VE has space Marines. They also have as I said people who don't do these things, Ivory tower, Hyper economists etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do NWO and Syndicate have dedicated research scientists?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","name":"Posthumanity","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T06:19:51-07:00","id":973798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Posthumanity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=973775#post973775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do NWO and Syndicate have dedicated research scientists?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. The NWO has the Collegia within the Ivory Tower. These are primarily academics who do heavy research into History and Psychology in order to better understand the transformation of ideas into reality. They also spend a great deal of time researching and writing essays on current affairs, political and sociological theories, psychological practices, media studies, and pretty much every other humanaties out there including Literature. They look for the ways in which the masses take to ideas and how ideas become status quo.<br /> <br /> Syndicate have Economists of every sort, from global economists, to local trade researchers, and stock market trade economists. They watch the ebb and flow of global funds. They keep an eye of how cash flow affects things at local level, a city wide level, a corporate level and a global level. They research statistical models of growth and try to predict what kind of impact various business ventures and economic schemes will have on both the big and small pictures. They have marketing engineers and product design researchers who's job it is to discover the various kinds of markets there are and figure out the easiest way to sell to them, and manipulate them in order to groom them into &quot;good consumers&quot;. They study the techniques of the past and try to adapt said technique or even create new ones for an ever changing and interconnected populous. For every new gains venture the Syndicate dabble, there will be a team of highly experienced business researchers behind them advising them on the best possible models for success.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":12193,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","user":"Saikou","date":". 09-21-2016, 09:23 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T06:40:59-07:00","id":973815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saikou</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=973798#post973798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes. The NWO has the Collegia within the Ivory Tower. These are primarily academics who do heavy research into History and Psychology in order to better understand the transformation of ideas into reality. They also spend a great deal of time researching and writing essays on current affairs, political and sociological theories, psychological practices, media studies, and pretty much every other humanaties out there including Literature. They look for the ways in which the masses take to ideas and how ideas become status quo.<br /> <br /> Syndicate have Economists of every sort, from global economists, to local trade researchers, and stock market trade economists. They watch the ebb and flow of global funds. They keep an eye of how cash flow affects things at local level, a city wide level, a corporate level and a global level. They research statistical models of growth and try to predict what kind of impact various business ventures and economic schemes will have on both the big and small pictures. They have marketing engineers and product design researchers who's job it is to discover the various kinds of markets there are and figure out the easiest way to sell to them, and manipulate them in order to groom them into &quot;good consumers&quot;. They study the techniques of the past and try to adapt said technique or even create new ones for an ever changing and interconnected populous. For every new gains venture the Syndicate dabble, there will be a team of highly experienced business researchers behind them advising them on the best possible models for success.</div> </div> </div> </div>And what about the hypertech? It has been mentioned that the Syndicate, most notably the Disbursements, keeps a large number of ultra-modern hypertech Ventures and corporate organizations at their disposal, though only a scant few of them are introduced in the CB as &quot;a selection of examples for play&quot;. I'm rather curious whether these technologies are developed by the Syndicate's own internal R&amp;D or relied upon their fabled outsourcing and/or Enlightened management.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11780,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","user":"Posthumanity","date":". 09-21-2016, 12:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","name":"Posthumanity","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T08:15:11-07:00","id":973863,"title":"","content":"Memetic weapons are probably the hypertech of the soft sciences. Imagine a contagious idea that convinces human beings, if they fail their Willpower roll, that they can fly if they jump off of the tallest building available? When released, it would be a weapon of mass disruption, as weak willed people within the contagion zone would be trying to fly by jumping off of tall building and, when they failed, would simply assume that they were not jumping from a high enough location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T10:56:52-07:00","id":973929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Posthumanity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=973815#post973815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And what about the hypertech? It has been mentioned that the Syndicate, most notably the Disbursements, keeps a large number of ultra-modern hypertech Ventures and corporate organizations at their disposal, though only a scant few of them are introduced in the CB as &quot;a selection of examples for play&quot;. I'm rather curious whether these technologies are developed by the Syndicate's own internal R&amp;D or relied upon their fabled outsourcing and/or Enlightened management.</div> </div> </div> </div>The answer to that question is &quot;Yes, of course.&quot; They have their own R&amp;D which produces Syndicate sourced hypertech. Said R&amp;D often &quot;has their way&quot; with the hypertech of other Conventions and puts the &quot;Syndicate spin&quot; on it. (This would probably happen to ANY tech which the Timeline wants to disburse to the Masses... the Syndicate are the Convention that makes new palatable.) The Syndicate farms out projects to other Conventions without any need to go through R&amp;D. (Imagine, if you will, a Syndicate/Progenitor Amalgam that is field-testing a new drug on the streets where the Progenitors are creating the effects of the drug based on the Syndicates desired specifications, or, vice-versa, if the Progenitors have a drug and they come to the Syndicate to help market or test it.) Then there is the Syndicate's sticky fingers in the projects of other Conventions as the resource allocations branch of the Union as a whole.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T11:08:51-07:00","id":973931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ajax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=973929#post973929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The answer to that question is &quot;Yes, of course.&quot; They have their own R&amp;D which produces Syndicate sourced hypertech. Said R&amp;D often &quot;has their way&quot; with the hypertech of other Conventions and puts the &quot;Syndicate spin&quot; on it. (This would probably happen to ANY tech which the Timeline wants to disburse to the Masses... the Syndicate are the Convention that makes new palatable.) The Syndicate farms out projects to other Conventions without any need to go through R&amp;D. (Imagine, if you will, a Syndicate/Progenitor Amalgam that is field-testing a new drug on the streets where the Progenitors are creating the effects of the drug based on the Syndicates desired specifications, or, vice-versa, if the Progenitors have a drug and they come to the Syndicate to help market or test it.) Then there is the Syndicate's sticky fingers in the projects of other Conventions as the resource allocations branch of the Union as a whole.</div> </div> </div> </div>So the Syndicate has its own independent, stand-alone R&amp;D since release of the third edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11780-posthumanity","name":"Posthumanity","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T06:16:38-07:00","id":975017,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Posthumanity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=973931#post973931\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the Syndicate has its own independent, stand-alone R&amp;D since release of the third edition?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, yes they are. Definitely. It is the party line. It has been elaborated several times over in their own book. So indeed our (in)famous uber-Syndicate is born, simultaneously sidelining other Conventions, most notably the NWO, and near-obsoleting dedicated R&amp;D Conventions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","user":"Numinous","date":". 09-23-2016, 09:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T08:45:41-07:00","id":975074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=975017#post975017\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, yes they are. Definitely. It is the party line. It has been elaborated several times over in their own book. So indeed our (in)famous uber-Syndicate is born, simultaneously sidelining other Conventions, most notably the NWO, and near-obsoleting dedicated R&amp;D Conventions.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not too hard to backpeddle from that position (though it's DEFINITELY in the game front and center at this point). Just have it be self-aggrandizing internal propaganda. After all these are the guys who invented the idea of commercial marketing based on outright impossibilities, lies and innuendo. So they are taking credit for what other Conventions do. They are making any tiny advancement their R&amp;D makes on a product as THE defining trait about it. (Like, say, the new iteration of each and every smartphone out there... the major function is pretty much the same, but oh so many pretty bells and whistles! And the sleek new casing! You simply MUST toss your current phone in the trash and get the NEW one! On the other hand, think of what smartphones would look like if we were working with the Iteration X version. Which would probably take a doctorate in computer engineering to operate properly. Dumb it down. Pretty it up. Push it out.)<br /> <br /> The Syndicate thinks they are the shit. The other Conventions grind their teeth, ignore it, look on in amused disdain or think &quot;Well, this is WHY they exist. They're our sales branch. That's their job. They keep the Timeline on time. Get the Masses to accept the advancements that are leading them to ultimate Ascension.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1062,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","user":"Ajax","date":". 09-23-2016, 12:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T09:02:58-07:00","id":975083,"title":"","content":"Yup, what Ajax said.<br /> Basically the Syndicate *is* important for giving the spin and shine and bells and whistles so the technology becomes just desired and wanted by sleepers. It's what the hypereconomy convention (among things) excels at. They also shovel tass in the direction of other conventions when they so desire.<br /> <br /> They even contract special R&amp;D Projects to those other conventions - but when it coems to R&amp;D the Syndicate does on their own, I handle it as mostly working in the confines of the absolutely best that mundane sleeper tech has to offer - after all, that's where the Syndicate can really pull strings, invest in companies, and make decisions.<br /> <br /> They don't only put the spin and spit and shine on other convention's technology that gets moved to the masses according to the timetable - they also continue working on it afterwards for maximizing profit, in the confines of sleeperdom. Any actual hypertech that remains inside those things is well hidden and subtle - like those items described in the conventionbook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://is.gd/wodchart\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Probability Chart</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodcalc\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Dice Statistics Calculator</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodarmor\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Armor System</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage\" target=\"_blank\">cWoD Alternative Damage Roll System</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/woddamage2\" target=\"_blank\">My explanation of cWoD Damage Levels</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodstrength\" target=\"_blank\">'Interesting' Strength Attribute Stuff</a><br /> <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodboom\" target=\"_blank\">EXPLOSIVE cWoD STUFF!</a> ||| <a href=\"https://is.gd/wodheresy\" target=\"_blank\">How Technocrats don't think they are Mages</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6606-ambrosia","name":"Ambrosia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6606_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T11:13:52-07:00","id":975134,"title":"","content":"And, of course, the bits that aren't subtle at all, but require Union know-how to unlock and properly use. Like the plasma-grenade detonation system in modern smartphones, or how modern Japan-based car manufacturers all leave in those legacy 'turn into a giant robot' instructions in their onboard computer and frame.<br /> <br /> There are advantages to having moles in <i>all</i> the standards review boards etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6072-quantumboost","name":"Quantumboost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6072_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"590"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T05:01:12-07:00","id":976471,"title":"","content":"I've always thought SYndicate R&amp;D was mostly geared towards trying to make IX and progenetor stuff into something Sleepers want/use. They are like Apple or Microsoft.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T09:13:59-07:00","id":976556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=976471#post976471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've always thought SYndicate R&amp;D was mostly geared towards trying to make IX and progenetor stuff into something Sleepers want/use. They are like Apple or Microsoft.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that definitely encapsulates one of their major missions: getting the stuff rolled out to the Masses in accordance with the Timeline (and the ultimate Ascension of Humanity). The Syndicate does other things as well and their R&amp;D would also be aimed in those directions. Plus, the Syndicate needs it's own ultra-cool gadgets, some of which can be appropriated and re-tasked but some will have to be developed out of whole-cloth.... THEN, there's all the &quot;invention&quot; of systems, etc. (immaterial stuff) to make the Syndicate function better and better. You can, after all, invent entirely new economic systems, advance cybernetics (original meaning, not the &quot;cyborg&quot; stuff), etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T17:40:16-07:00","id":987014,"title":"","content":"No Mages are scientists, as science takes has its fundamental principles that we don't know many things, and need to discover them. The fundamental conceit of Mage is anti-scientific, since reality isn't something discovered, but rather forced by willpower, whether the willpower of an individual Mage, or the collective will of the masses. What Mages are, regardless of sect, are politicians. They have a certain worldview, and spend their time trying to convince the masses of that worldview.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T19:48:26-07:00","id":987069,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=987014#post987014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No Mages are scientists, as science takes has its fundamental principles that we don't know many things, and need to discover them. The fundamental conceit of Mage is anti-scientific, since reality isn't something discovered, but rather forced by willpower, whether the willpower of an individual Mage, or the collective will of the masses. What Mages are, regardless of sect, are politicians. They have a certain worldview, and spend their time trying to convince the masses of that worldview.</div> </div> </div> </div>I doubt that. Most mages don't spend much time at all having to convince anyone of anything (unless they are Mind mages). Sure, it would be just dandy if everyone thought that the weird stuff I can do is normal, but, actually, I don't need them to believe in me. At all. I can DO IT ALL without giving a fig about what they believe. Of course, I CAN spend all my time trying to edjumicate the unwashed masses to make my life easier, but, really, that's thankless and hard and doesn't really accomplish very much. And it takes pretty much all the time away from me being able to do amazing magical things. <br /> <br /> Oh, and science is definitely trying to force a particular worldview. And it doesn't depend on awareness of ignorance. It relies on a fundamental assumption of the correctness of positivist logical reasoning. You've got to believe in the legitimacy of observation and of the observer to even START &quot;doing science&quot;. And so on, through the steps of the Scientific Method.....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T19:35:36-07:00","id":993254,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/973670-are-the-nwo-and-the-syndicate-scientists-by-the-square?p=987014#post987014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No Mages are scientists, as science takes has its fundamental principles that we don't know many things, and need to discover them. The fundamental conceit of Mage is anti-scientific, since reality isn't something discovered, but rather forced by willpower, whether the willpower of an individual Mage, or the collective will of the masses. What Mages are, regardless of sect, are politicians. They have a certain worldview, and spend their time trying to convince the masses of that worldview.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> By that standard, scientists aren't scientists because the scientific method is different from real world science, which is a social process and not a completely fixed set of rules for the study of nature.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Writer, Game Designer, Pro since 99.<br /> <br /> Thoughts at <a href=\"http://mobunited.com\" target=\"_blank\">mobunited.com</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/164-malcolm","name":"Malcolm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-25T19:43:06-07:00","id":993260,"title":"","content":"You already own Syndicate hypertech. You just don't have access to all of the features. You can't see personal data for search engine users, hit a secret combination of buttons to boot to an alternative OS you didn't know existed, profile personalities by clothing and music selections with great accuracy, give people earworms that will drive them mad, or buy preferred stock in anything at any time.<br /> <br /> That said, the Syndicate doubtlessly has its own scientists and engineers who make things. The difference is that they operate on a smaller scale, with less ultimate understanding of a given discipline, and less efficiently. All the Conventions have their own specialists in every field, but the situation is the same. They're less efficient and have less of an understanding and creative vision than the Conventions that excel in certain fields. So yeah, there's a Syndicate guy that makes robots, but they'll never be as good as ItX robots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Writer, Game Designer, Pro since 99.<br /> <br /> Thoughts at <a href=\"http://mobunited.com\" target=\"_blank\">mobunited.com</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/164-malcolm","name":"Malcolm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar164_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}